  "id": "mae-vs-rmse",
  "after": "selfCheck",
  "title": "Same MAE, very different RMSE.",
  "caption": "Both models miss by ₹40,000 on average (MAE). Model B gets four cars almost right but misses one car by ₹1,60,000. RMSE squares the misses before averaging, so that one big miss pulls RMSE up to about ₹72,000. A big gap (अंतर, antar) between RMSE and MAE means a few very big misses.",
  "alt": "Two bar charts of the misses for five cars, in thousands of rupees. Model A misses every car by 40, so MAE is ₹40,000 and RMSE is ₹40,000. Model B misses four cars by 10 and one car by 160, so MAE is still ₹40,000 but RMSE is about ₹72,000. A note says a big gap between RMSE and MAE means a few huge misses.",
  "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 348\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><text x=\"16\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Model A</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"41\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">all misses equal</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"214\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"214\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"22\" y=\"180\" width=\"22\" height=\"34\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-s1\"/><text x=\"33\" y=\"174\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">40</text><text x=\"33\" y=\"231\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\">c1</text><rect x=\"52\" y=\"180\" width=\"22\" height=\"34\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-s1\"/><text x=\"63\" y=\"174\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">40</text><text x=\"63\" y=\"231\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\">c2</text><rect x=\"82\" y=\"180\" width=\"22\" height=\"34\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-s1\"/><text x=\"93\" y=\"174\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">40</text><text x=\"93\" y=\"231\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\">c3</text><rect x=\"112\" y=\"180\" width=\"22\" height=\"34\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-s1\"/><text x=\"123\" y=\"174\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">40</text><text x=\"123\" y=\"231\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\">c4</text><rect x=\"142\" y=\"180\" width=\"22\" height=\"34\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-s1\"/><text x=\"153\" y=\"174\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">40</text><text x=\"153\" y=\"231\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\">c5</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"256\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\">MAE ₹40,000</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"278\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\">RMSE ₹40,000</text><text x=\"190\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Model B</text><text x=\"190\" y=\"41\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">one huge miss</text><line x1=\"190\" y1=\"214\" x2=\"344\" y2=\"214\" class=\"s-muted\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"196\" y=\"205.5\" width=\"22\" height=\"8.5\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-s1\"/><text x=\"207\" y=\"199.5\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10</text><text x=\"207\" y=\"231\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\">c1</text><rect x=\"226\" y=\"205.5\" width=\"22\" height=\"8.5\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-s1\"/><text x=\"237\" y=\"199.5\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10</text><text x=\"237\" y=\"231\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\">c2</text><rect x=\"256\" y=\"78\" width=\"22\" height=\"136\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-bad-soft s-sindoor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"267\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">160</text><text x=\"267\" y=\"231\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\">c3</text><rect x=\"286\" y=\"205.5\" width=\"22\" height=\"8.5\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-s1\"/><text x=\"297\" y=\"199.5\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10</text><text x=\"297\" y=\"231\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\">c4</text><rect x=\"316\" y=\"205.5\" width=\"22\" height=\"8.5\" rx=\"2\" class=\"f-s1\"/><text x=\"327\" y=\"199.5\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10</text><text x=\"327\" y=\"231\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"middle\">c5</text><text x=\"190\" y=\"256\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\">MAE ₹40,000</text><text x=\"190\" y=\"278\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\">RMSE ≈ ₹72,000</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"312\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">Misses in ₹ thousand, for 5 cars (c1 to c5).</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"336\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">A big RMSE − MAE gap = a few huge misses.</text></svg>"
